      "verdict": "met",
      "lines": "packages/cli/src/utils/storage-driver.ts:352 `const scheme = /^[a-z][a-z0-9+.-]*:\\/\\//i.exec(u)?.[0] ?? /^[a-z][a-z0-9+.-]+:/i.exec(u)?.[0];` (the second test needs two or more characters before the colon, so a one-letter drive is no scheme); :353-359 throw UnsupportedDriverError(scheme, unsupportedUrlSchemeMessage(scheme), { recognized: false }), the same type and sentence as the SCHEME:// refusal; :340 returns file: / sqlite: before it.",
